# Inside the Belly (otherAreas 26) with its era module, enabled by xi.pre(SOA) alone (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0):
# the 2012 batch (Abaia, Matsya) blocked; the trigger the quest's own.
# FISHING_ENABLE (P6): `setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true` in the header; every section reads xi.settings.map.FISHING_ENABLE == true
# (false in settings/default/map.lua).
# Completed (a GM), skill 30. An Abaia and a Matsya: nothing, kept. A Soryu (RoV, on): 166 or 167. A Grimmonite (Abyssea, on):
# 166 or 167.
module modules/era/lua/quests/otherareas/inside_the_belly.lua
lists Selbina/Zaldon/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/166 Selbina/onEventFinish/167
char zone=Selbina pos=-10.3,-7.287,-6.742 job=WAR lvl=30
setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest OtherAreas.InsideTheBelly completed
skill Fishing 300
item Abaia
item Matsya
item Soryu
item Grimmonite
login
trade Zaldon Abaia x1                   # blocked: nothing; kept
trade Zaldon Matsya x1                  # blocked: nothing; kept
trade Zaldon Soryu x1                   # on: <= 468: 166 (the Soryu's Liver), else 167
finish                                  # 1512 gil
trade Zaldon Grimmonite x1              # on: 166 or 167
finish                                  # 350 gil
